{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_008_02_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:de8adcbfd5d4fbf0e4a44fbe7d346d98d23509e53a86b8dbe260186f262e5075",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bf025e2a168a534c215d81ad0fd338b1cdef6d503a2531e55060eea8a46a5c7",
      "text": "我找到了这样一张传单。\n“高中生乐队大赛”！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_d:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b33c6136e03bcc657da4c4f77b494f2887a89198331b2226d5bde8f3d779b6a",
      "text": "高中生乐队大赛！？\n那是什么，感觉让人热血沸腾啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1929c7125b4cc17f53c8f948f4ec47bdd2a69f73df17d3e4a1dfe586cb3d823",
      "text": "说是召集各地高中生乐队的比赛。\n去参加这个怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_d:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a946b61babb8973c931aa1154894c1c6e7108f147184a5d9f06699399f8cd85",
      "text": "哦，很好啊！\n只要在这个比赛拿到好成绩，我的留级危机也……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_d:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abd59ec77af36cdb9fce78310993723d99c39d2792852e53793ed9bacd13c7a5",
      "text": "参加大赛太乱来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_d:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f4f2e9f990dda87f7f4d00f769629697eddd4ac001fc2e877301ca3d12fdc5b",
      "text": "哎哎——！为什么啊，旬亲！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_d:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb7d2fb532030baaa377688425b4bc107cd30ec97fcdbc3ed2ecf346950b40d9",
      "text": "我们的轻音部，全都是乐器初学者这种外行。\n这样的乐队就算去参赛，也只会自取其辱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_d:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fca684f529947c2e9b17249d694b76f763b19886d173c79ff974784d35570ee0",
      "text": "会吗？\n我觉得我们其实挺行的啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_d:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:973ac8d2731381d909b53d6a664c2eb9ff5ff5a47cf0a58f161ddd45b44156d7",
      "text": "我也这么觉得！\n前辈们的演奏，简直超级MAX厉害！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_d:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b52ff7ec28a4bfd95fe3ad652578bd00cf318304138f536ab1bb48f2c2ae4d7",
      "text": "夏来怎么觉得？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_d:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39ccd33582a62868adcc66a3dffdb5ccde226ea6eb22f84b3bf9b30f71796bd4",
      "text": "我……听旬的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_d:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a42a385b1a88da9fc6f4855addaf8fe9ea48d3b2d35220a40dd06ba50bcf93ef",
      "text": "那么，只要旬同意就算通过了对吧！\n来吧，旬！你怎么说！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_d:cmd-000153:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a9b0826eeeaccdec26149e64c32a0fad3cd886e0493604922d92b2d715ee83b",
      "text": "…………\n我知道了。好吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_d:cmd-000170:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:576ca0e715d9875665ab595b16c260efd7133ed2985ecc40df7a9ed969fbc82c",
      "text": "太棒了，就这么定了！\n目标是，拿下冠军——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_d:cmd-000183:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:118aee67a2c5c58c34b2ac9a4245cc64e699c55fae3e2a7d526bd3d2967f6821",
      "text": "……一上来就要夺冠，怎么可能做到。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
